{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model combining scvi_n200 RNA encoding with resnet50 image features using concat fusion. Validation accuracy of 0.6315 (vs. 0.65 in RNA-only baseline) and F1 of 0.6068 suggest no significant improvement from adding image data. The role of concat fusion and potential interactions between modalities remain uncertain, as the result provides a baseline for further exploration of multimodal design choices."
}

